 third degree  burns  worst case you're dissolved into a fizzy  goo  so follow the park rules and don't  wander off the designated paths  of course that will never guarantee your  safety after all Yellowstone Park does  sit on top of an active super volcano  and it might be ready to erupt any day  now  but that's a story  or another  [Music]

